# { "message": { "command": "<what was typed in the Commands tab>" } }





### 1. echo via /api/method  -> 200, message.method == "POST", query has a=1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/method/echo?a=1
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"hello": "world"
}

# {
#   "message": {
#     "method": "POST",
#     "query": { "a": "1", "hello": "world" },
#     "user": "<your user id>"
#   }
# }



### 2. echo via /api/v2/method  -> 200, same payload under "data"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/echo?a=2
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"hello": "v2"
}



### 3. wrong verb  -> 405 Method Not Allowed (Allow: POST); still logged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/method/echo?a=3
Authorization: token {{token}}



### 4. no token  -> 401/403 (Server Script is never guest-callable); logged with user = Guest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/method/echo?a=4
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"hello": "guest"
}



### 5. the API One Log rows written by 1-4 (newest first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/frappe.client.get_list
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"doctype": "API One Log",
	"fields": ["name", "creation", "api_path", "request_method", "request_query", "response_status_code", "user", "ip_address", "duration_ms"],
	"filters": [["api_path", "=", "echo"]],
	"order_by": "creation desc",
	"limit": 10
}



### 6. one API One Log row in full (replace APILOG2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/document/API One Log/APILOG2
Authorization: token {{token}}



### 7. the registered endpoints
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/frappe.client.get_list
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"doctype": "API One",
	"fields": ["name", "api_path", "request_method", "enabled", "server_script"],
	"order_by": "creation desc"
}



### 8. define a new endpoint over REST (caller needs the Script Manager role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/document/API One
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"api_path": "my_open_enquiries",
	"request_method": "GET",
	"enabled": 1,
	"script": "frappe.response['message'] = frappe.get_list('Enquiry', filters={'status': ['not in', ['Won', 'Lost']]}, fields=['name', 'date', 'status', 'enquiry_details'], order_by='creation desc', limit=20)"
}

# then:
#   GET {{baseUrl}}/api/method/my_open_enquiries
#   Authorization: token {{token}}
# Posting the same api_path again -> 409 Duplicate API Path.



### 9. disable the sample endpoint (replace API1) -> subsequent calls return 404 and are logged
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/document/API One/API1
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"enabled": 0
}



